1
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:01,439
Driver, are we going the wrong way?

2
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,240
Aren't we taking the highway back to Lacheng?

3
00:01:03,679 --> 00:01:04,799
Aren't you in a hurry?

4
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:05,879
I'm taking a shortcut.

5
00:01:06,239 --> 00:01:06,680
Don't worry.

6
00:01:06,959 --> 00:01:07,680
I know this route.

7
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:08,439
Trust me.

8
00:01:10,719 --> 00:01:11,359
Thanks.

9
00:03:20,479 --> 00:03:22,639
Dad, I killed you.

10
00:03:34,919 --> 00:03:36,520
Dad, aren't you eating?

11
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:38,800
Daddy's got a big driving job today

12
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:39,840
to make some good money.

13
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:42,159
When I get back, I'll buy you a big toy gun.

14
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,319
Yay!

15
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,400
Dad!

16
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:46,159
You're back!

17
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:46,960
You bet!

18
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:48,439
We've got to spend New Year's together.

19
00:03:49,039 --> 00:03:49,560
Okay!

20
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,159
Go on inside.

21
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,080
Come back quick!

22
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:53,759
Will do.

23
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:56,919
Watch your step, don't fall!

24
00:03:58,319 --> 00:03:58,919
Got you!

25
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:01,439
Daddy!

26
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,800
Grandma told me to give you a meat bun.

27
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:08,800
Thanks.

28
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,000
Head on back now.

29
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,120
Dad.

30
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:27,120
Grandma told me to give you a meat bun.

31
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,839
Why are you back?

32
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,639
What's wrong?

33
00:04:54,959 --> 00:04:55,920
Did you mess up?

34
00:04:58,399 --> 00:04:59,279
Say something!

35
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:06,959
My dad wasn't drinking.

36
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,279
I looked into it.

37
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:17,839
My dad wasn't drinking.

38
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,519
Go, Sister Xuemei!

39
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,839
Died right on the bench.

40
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:39,600
I had no idea.

41
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,399
Thought she was just asleep.

42
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:48,240
Where's her bag?

43
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,560
Liu Xuemei's bag is gone.

44
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,560
I'll get it to you later.

45
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:10,120
As for Cao Jun's case,

46
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,120
the investigation is fully wrapped up.

47
00:08:11,839 --> 00:08:14,920
It's also confirmed that the deaths of Ma and Qian

48
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,959
have no connection to Cao Jun's case.

49
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:20,600
We need to readjust our investigation.

50
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,160
According to Chen Qingchun's confession,

51
00:08:23,519 --> 00:08:25,439
the night Qian Yichuan was attacked,

52
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:27,319
at Old Workers' Haven,

53
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,519
Cheng Youtian and Liu Tieping

54
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,680
had a fierce argument with Qian Yichuan.

55
00:08:32,639 --> 00:08:33,799
When the crime took place,

56
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:35,200
where were the master and apprentice?

57
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,399
Chen Qingchun said

58
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,039
that after Qian Yichuan left,

59
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,279
everyone parted on bad terms,

60
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,480
leaving only the master and apprentice.

61
00:08:43,279 --> 00:08:45,159
The day Qian Yichuan fell to his death,

62
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:46,720
did the two of them

63
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,039
have an alibi?

64
00:08:48,559 --> 00:08:50,679
Based on our recent findings,

65
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:51,679
Liu Tieping,

66
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,759
aside from work,

67
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,480
went straight to Old Workers' Haven

68
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,679
to keep his master company.

69
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:01,279
Besides grocery shopping and cooking,

70
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:03,399
they have almost no outside contact.

71
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:06,840
So they're each other's alibis.

72
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,279
Does that even count as proof?

73
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,120
Keep digging.

74
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,480
Gao Xuelin, Xiao Wu,

75
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:16,480
keep your eyes glued to Cheng and Liu.

76
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,720
Report anything suspicious immediately.

77
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:19,679
Copy that.

78
00:09:19,799 --> 00:09:20,399
Captain Han,

79
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:21,600
get a team together

80
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:23,440
and reinvestigate

81
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:24,799
Ma Guowen

82
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,200
and Qian Yichuan's backgrounds.

83
00:09:26,279 --> 00:09:26,679
Understood.

84
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,440
Xiao Cai,

85
00:09:28,039 --> 00:09:29,080
question Tu Chunyan again

86
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:30,519
and see if she has any new leads.

87
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:31,519
Will do.

88
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,159
Before Ma Guowen beats us to it,

89
00:09:47,159 --> 00:09:48,120
let's buy the factory ourselves.

90
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:48,759
Buy it?

91
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,200
Just the few of us?

92
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,399
Where are we gonna get that kind of money?

93
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:52,120
We'll figure something out!

94
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,000
We can reach out to— Saved these just for you.

95
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,039
—people we know! Homemade dumplings.

96
00:09:54,039 --> 00:09:55,039
People we can trust!

97
00:09:55,159 --> 00:09:55,919
Will that really work?

98
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:56,679
What are you doing?

99
00:09:56,759 --> 00:09:59,240
Didn't you say a single spark can start a prairie fire?

100
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,120
Prairie fire my ass.

101
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:00,879
Careful, it's hot.

102
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:03,320
Before we even sort it out, Ma Guowen will wipe us out.

103
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,679
Eat slowly.

104
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,639
They're still warm.

105
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:09,360
Have a few more.

106
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,000
What are you doing?!

107
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:13,440
Get in here!

108
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:13,919
Who's that?

109
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:15,799
Wait—

110
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,159
she was outside just now,

111
00:10:17,159 --> 00:10:18,320
recording everything you said.

112
00:10:18,519 --> 00:10:19,000
What's going on?

113
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:20,480
Why... why are you recording this?

114
00:10:20,639 --> 00:10:21,240
Who sent you?

115
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:54,639
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

116
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:58,759
He kissed Shunzi!

117
00:10:58,759 --> 00:10:59,960
Why the hell are you kissing me?!

118
00:11:00,679 --> 00:11:02,120
He kissed Shunzi, so I kissed the wrong guy!

119
00:11:03,399 --> 00:11:04,159
Shunzi!

120
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,240
What the hell are you doing?

121
00:11:05,639 --> 00:11:06,840
Alright, knock it off, you guys!

122
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,480
He kissed Shunzi.

123
00:11:20,679 --> 00:11:21,440
Shunzi!

124
00:11:21,759 --> 00:11:22,519
What are you doing?

125
00:11:22,559 --> 00:11:23,320
Alright, that's enough.

126
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,000
Officer Han,

127
00:11:41,559 --> 00:11:42,360
I need to talk to you.

128
00:11:44,559 --> 00:11:46,080
I went through that unused footage from back then,

129
00:11:46,919 --> 00:11:48,080
and found a few spots

130
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:50,159
that might be leads for your case.

131
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,039
The exact timecodes...

132
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,120
I've already marked them.

133
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:56,559
I'll bring them over to you.

134
00:11:58,759 --> 00:12:00,440
This is our report regarding

135
00:12:00,679 --> 00:12:02,840
the three brutal homicides

136
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:05,120
at Lapi Brewery this month.

137
00:12:05,399 --> 00:12:07,600
The killer in Cao Jun's case

138
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,480
has already been apprehended.

139
00:12:08,759 --> 00:12:09,559
The Ma Guowen case

140
00:12:09,679 --> 00:12:12,759
shares the exact same MO as Qian Yichuan's.

141
00:12:13,039 --> 00:12:15,200
Could it be the work of the same killer?

142
00:12:15,799 --> 00:12:18,039
After screening the social ties of both victims,

143
00:12:18,159 --> 00:12:19,840
three prime suspects have emerged.

144
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:20,840
First,

145
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:23,120
former brewery workshop director Cheng Youtian.

146
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:23,879
Second,

147
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,559
former propaganda section chief Zhao Haipeng.

148
00:12:25,799 --> 00:12:26,320
Third,

149
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,960
brewery worker Liu Tieping.

150
00:12:28,639 --> 00:12:29,600
All three of them

151
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:30,799
were involved back then

152
00:12:30,799 --> 00:12:32,559
in the auction of Lapi Brewery.

153
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,879
They also meet the key condition

154
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:36,720
of being familiar with the crime scenes.

155
00:12:37,919 --> 00:12:38,960
After Ma Guowen was murdered,

156
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:41,600
all three showed up at a gathering of former co-workers.

157
00:12:42,519 --> 00:12:44,440
According to Chen Qingchun's confession,

158
00:12:44,879 --> 00:12:46,960
before his death, Qian Yichuan had a heated clash

159
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,799
with the master and apprentice,

160
00:12:48,799 --> 00:12:50,960
Cheng Youtian and Liu Tieping.

161
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:54,960
Qian Yichuan also hurled insults at Liu Xuemei.

162
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:56,960
That's all.

163
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,320
Captain Cheng.

164
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:00,799
Shen Leshui

165
00:13:00,799 --> 00:13:01,960
brought over some tapes

166
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,799
of unused footage shot back then.

167
00:13:04,279 --> 00:13:05,679
From these tapes,

168
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:06,799
we found a few clues as well.

169
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:07,759
First off,

170
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,279
she mentioned that when Liu Xuemei went to the auction,

171
00:13:10,279 --> 00:13:11,240
she carried a handbag.

172
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:14,159
Yet where she froze to death, the bag was missing.

173
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:15,240
Also,

174
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:16,360
Xiao Wu,

175
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,559
play the clip.

176
00:13:18,039 --> 00:13:18,759
Three minutes and six seconds.

177
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:20,600
Look.

178
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,159
Shen Leshui told me

179
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,080
Liu Tieping shot this footage.

180
00:13:24,559 --> 00:13:25,960
And throughout this shot,

181
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,159
he only filmed Liu Xuemei.

182
00:13:29,679 --> 00:13:31,720
Play from ten minutes and fifteen seconds.

183
00:13:32,279 --> 00:13:32,639
Okay.

184
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:33,679
Pause it here.

185
00:13:33,759 --> 00:13:34,080
Okay.

186
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:35,519
Right here.

187
00:13:36,159 --> 00:13:37,159
Everyone, take a look.

188
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:40,080
Look at how Liu Tieping stares at Liu Xuemei.

189
00:13:41,679 --> 00:13:42,600
In the unused footage

190
00:13:42,759 --> 00:13:45,279
that Shen Leshui gave us,

191
00:13:45,519 --> 00:13:47,639
there are many looks like this.

192
00:13:47,879 --> 00:13:48,799
At first,

193
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:52,159
the entire focus of our investigation

194
00:13:52,399 --> 00:13:53,399
was placed on

195
00:13:53,759 --> 00:13:56,320
finding Liu Xuemei's lover in Qingzhou.

196
00:13:56,919 --> 00:13:59,799
After Chen Yuan's footage theft case was solved,

197
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:03,080
it proved he was indeed Liu Xuemei's lover.

198
00:14:04,559 --> 00:14:05,799
However, in the murders

199
00:14:05,799 --> 00:14:08,679
of Ma Guowen and Qian Yichuan,

200
00:14:08,919 --> 00:14:11,320
Chen Yuan had solid alibis for both.

201
00:14:11,559 --> 00:14:13,799
That cleared Chen Yuan of suspicion.

202
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,960
And our leads hit a dead end.

203
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:17,399
Luckily, Shen Leshui

204
00:14:17,399 --> 00:14:18,879
brought us the tapes of unused footage.

205
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,480
In these tapes,

206
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:21,879
someone very inconspicuous

207
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:24,559
finally came into our sights.

208
00:14:25,159 --> 00:14:27,039
That man is Liu Tieping.

209
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:28,320
As for him,

210
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,279
he was involved in all the preparations

211
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,519
for the factory auction back then.

212
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:34,600
Plus, he knew the victims well.

213
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:35,799
With the victims,

214
00:14:35,799 --> 00:14:38,159
he had deep social ties and emotional baggage.

215
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,360
Most importantly,

216
00:14:40,399 --> 00:14:43,600
he harbored romantic feelings for Liu Xuemei.

217
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:47,120
When he learned she froze to death,

218
00:14:47,639 --> 00:14:49,720
and that people were calling her a traitor,

219
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,960
he didn't believe it.

220
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:54,159
He had a motive to kill Ma Guowen.

221
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,279
As for the victim Qian Yichuan,

222
00:14:56,279 --> 00:14:58,679
When he was alive, he firmly believed she was a traitor.

223
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:02,480
And during gatherings with old coworkers,

224
00:15:02,519 --> 00:15:04,399
he repeatedly insulted Liu Xuemei in public.

225
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,799
Liu Tieping was present every time.

226
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,159
This could also be

227
00:15:09,159 --> 00:15:11,200
his motive to kill Qian Yichuan.

228
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,759
Of course, this is just speculation.

229
00:15:13,879 --> 00:15:14,879
As for Liu Tieping,

230
00:15:15,279 --> 00:15:16,039
he's an orphan.

231
00:15:16,559 --> 00:15:18,480
Cheng Youtian raised him.

232
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:19,879
When he grew up,

233
00:15:19,879 --> 00:15:21,960
Cheng Youtian brought him into Lapi Brewery.

234
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,679
Liu Tieping took Cheng Youtian as his mentor.

235
00:15:25,679 --> 00:15:27,440
The two of them share an extremely close bond.

236
00:15:29,519 --> 00:15:30,360
Following this logic,

237
00:15:31,159 --> 00:15:32,960
we can't rule out they committed the crimes together.

238
00:15:33,879 --> 00:15:34,240
Captain Han,

239
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,120
put surveillance on both of them immediately.

240
00:15:36,399 --> 00:15:37,039
Make the arrangements.

241
00:15:37,559 --> 00:15:38,200
Yes, sir.

242
00:15:39,399 --> 00:15:40,080
Thirty-two.

243
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:41,360
Just make it thirty, bro. It's freezing out!

244
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:45,720
Here you go.

245
00:15:45,879 --> 00:15:46,480
Thanks.

246
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,240
Getting some fish, brother?

247
00:15:48,559 --> 00:15:49,320
Come have some noodles!

248
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,000
Sure, sure.

249
00:16:29,759 --> 00:16:30,600
I just checked around.

250
00:16:31,639 --> 00:16:32,240
There's no back door.

251
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,919
Didn't I tell you?

252
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:34,679
It's a semi-basement.

253
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:35,720
There's only that one door.

254
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,240
Just keep an eye on that door.

255
00:16:37,399 --> 00:16:38,200
They can't even crawl out.

256
00:16:39,039 --> 00:16:39,440
Thanks.

257
00:16:50,759 --> 00:16:51,879
Here, have some pickled cabbage.

258
00:16:52,519 --> 00:16:53,440
Thanks. Thank you, boss.

259
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:54,080
Thank you, boss.

260
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:54,879
Taste all right?

261
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:55,639
Really good. Really good, authentic.

262
00:16:55,639 --> 00:16:56,519
Real authentic.

263
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:19,599
Master Cheng.

264
00:17:21,799 --> 00:17:22,480
Shunzi!

265
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,599
What a rare sight!

266
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,039
What, not welcome?

267
00:17:26,039 --> 00:17:26,640
I'll take off then.

268
00:17:27,319 --> 00:17:27,839
Come on, don't do that.

269
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,599
Look right here.

270
00:17:30,839 --> 00:17:32,160
You say the days are long,

271
00:17:32,279 --> 00:17:33,240
and I'll pour the drinks.

272
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:34,079
Bring a bottle!

273
00:17:34,759 --> 00:17:35,839
Tieping, bring some drinks!

274
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:37,319
Tieping!

275
00:17:37,319 --> 00:17:38,279
Aren't you working today?

276
00:17:40,599 --> 00:17:41,279
Didn't the factory go bust?

277
00:17:41,279 --> 00:17:41,960
What job would I go to?

278
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:44,519
I'll get it myself. I've got it.

279
00:17:44,799 --> 00:17:45,440
Shunzi,

280
00:17:46,079 --> 00:17:47,039
what would you like to eat?

281
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:49,200
Just some handmade noodles.

282
00:17:49,559 --> 00:17:50,319
Alright.

283
00:17:51,359 --> 00:17:51,880
Also...

284
00:17:52,599 --> 00:17:54,039
Throw in two cold dishes on the house.

285
00:17:55,119 --> 00:17:55,799
Thanks, Master Cheng.

286
00:17:58,720 --> 00:17:59,319
Just leave it there.

287
00:17:59,359 --> 00:17:59,960
Tieping,

288
00:18:00,519 --> 00:18:01,559
come give me a hand.

289
00:18:03,279 --> 00:18:03,920
Coming.

290
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:58,839
Tieping,

291
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,200
don't go out these days.

292
00:19:01,839 --> 00:19:03,240
And don't contact anyone either.

293
00:19:03,799 --> 00:19:04,400
Right now,

294
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,759
nobody can be trusted.

295
00:19:07,559 --> 00:19:08,079
I'll be fine.

296
00:19:08,559 --> 00:19:09,640
I'll be extra careful outside.

297
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:13,119
You'd better not go out at all.

298
00:19:13,759 --> 00:19:14,960
Staying here is the safest.

299
00:19:15,279 --> 00:19:15,759
You hear me?

300
00:19:18,359 --> 00:19:19,400
Master, don't go out either.

301
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:20,440
If you need anything,

302
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:21,160
just tell me.

303
00:19:21,279 --> 00:19:21,880
I'll go get it.

304
00:19:22,559 --> 00:19:23,400
No need for you to go.

305
00:19:24,079 --> 00:19:24,960
I've got it all handled.

306
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:33,960
Master Cheng,

307
00:19:35,319 --> 00:19:36,559
no rush, take your time.

308
00:19:36,759 --> 00:19:37,440
I'm in no hurry.

309
00:19:38,559 --> 00:19:39,559
What sauce do you want?

310
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:41,160
Hot pepper and eggplant.

311
00:19:41,319 --> 00:19:42,240
No peppers.

312
00:19:42,599 --> 00:19:43,119
What do you have?

313
00:19:43,119 --> 00:19:43,759
Just cabbage.

314
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:44,480
Fine.

315
00:19:45,759 --> 00:19:46,279
Hold on a bit.

316
00:19:54,160 --> 00:19:54,599
Tieping,

317
00:19:55,519 --> 00:19:56,319
what are you thinking about?

318
00:20:04,799 --> 00:20:05,400
Nothing.

319
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:09,279
Master, what do you think of Shen Leshui?

320
00:20:10,279 --> 00:20:11,119
Whatever she's like

321
00:20:11,119 --> 00:20:11,960
is none of your business.

322
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,279
Do you think she looks like a thief?

323
00:20:16,359 --> 00:20:17,759
What did I just say?

324
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:21,160
I'm just analyzing.

325
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,720
Analyzing my foot.

326
00:20:24,039 --> 00:20:25,039
Just drop it already.

327
00:20:25,519 --> 00:20:26,079
Tieping,

328
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:28,000
let's set some ground rules.

329
00:20:28,839 --> 00:20:29,960
From now on,

330
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:31,759
you don't leave my sight.

331
00:20:33,599 --> 00:20:34,359
You hear me?

332
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:37,440
If you don't behave,

333
00:20:38,039 --> 00:20:38,799
I'll lock you in the back room.

334
00:20:42,599 --> 00:20:43,200
Yes, sir.

335
00:20:47,079 --> 00:20:47,759
Wash the cabbage.

336
00:20:52,599 --> 00:20:53,400
Shunzi,

337
00:20:54,799 --> 00:20:57,079
do you want thick or thin noodles?

338
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:58,880
Whatever you pull, I'll eat.

339
00:20:59,519 --> 00:21:00,680
As long as it's hot.

340
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,480
Alright.

341
00:21:38,839 --> 00:21:39,359
Master,

342
00:21:40,079 --> 00:21:40,559
have some water.

343
00:23:06,079 --> 00:23:06,799
Brother Chuang, it's me.

344
00:23:07,039 --> 00:23:07,920
It's an emergency.

345
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:09,640
I don't know what happened to Cheng Youtian,

346
00:23:09,640 --> 00:23:10,680
but they put him in an ambulance.

347
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:11,960
Liu Tieping is with them, too.

348
00:23:12,839 --> 00:23:13,519
Tail them.

349
00:23:13,839 --> 00:23:15,559
Got it. I'll keep you posted right away.

350
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:22,240
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

351
00:24:22,279 --> 00:24:23,160
I'm watching him, I'm on him.

352
00:24:29,880 --> 00:24:30,680
Hey, Brother Lin.

353
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:31,960
Tieping's gone!

354
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:33,480
Just while we were on the phone!

355
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:41,000
Brother Lin.

356
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:42,319
I see him!

357
00:24:42,359 --> 00:24:43,680
Right where we crossed paths earlier.

358
00:24:43,839 --> 00:24:44,720
What the hell is wrong with you?

359
00:24:44,720 --> 00:24:45,480
He's right above my head—

360
00:24:45,559 --> 00:24:46,559
Look, isn't he right here?

361
00:24:49,119 --> 00:24:49,920
Scared the hell out of me.

362
00:24:50,079 --> 00:24:51,359
You scared the hell out of me!

363
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:52,880
As long as he's there.

364
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:05,960
Nurse!

365
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:07,799
Where's the family of the patient in Bed Two?

366
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:09,400
I only look after patients, not their families.

367
00:25:09,599 --> 00:25:11,039
Didn't he just come drop off the form?

368
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:12,319
The form is on the counter.

369
00:25:13,359 --> 00:25:14,279
Damn it, this is bad.

370
00:25:14,759 --> 00:25:15,480
Damn it, damn it!

371
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:26,920
See him?

372
00:25:27,319 --> 00:25:27,720
No.

373
00:25:30,759 --> 00:25:31,359
Damn it.

374
00:25:31,720 --> 00:25:32,519
Call Brother Chuang.

375
00:25:33,279 --> 00:25:34,200
Liu Tieping is gone.

376
00:25:39,319 --> 00:25:39,839
Brother Chuang!

377
00:25:40,319 --> 00:25:41,319
Liu Tieping is gone! Aren't you watching the patients?

378
00:25:41,519 --> 00:25:42,319
Where's the patient in Bed Two?

379
00:25:42,319 --> 00:25:42,960
We can't find him!

380
00:25:43,759 --> 00:25:44,799
He was just here! We only—

381
00:25:44,799 --> 00:25:45,720
We're on the first floor right now.

382
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:47,559
The second we walked in, Liu Tieping was gone.

383
00:25:48,400 --> 00:25:49,480
His IV isn't even finished!

384
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:50,160
We just stepped in,

385
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:50,720
and he was gone!

386
00:25:52,759 --> 00:25:53,880
Brother Chuang, it's Xiao Gao.

387
00:25:54,119 --> 00:25:55,039
Cheng Youtian escaped too.

388
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:59,000
Useless idiots!

389
00:26:00,079 --> 00:26:00,519
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

390
00:26:00,519 --> 00:26:01,079
Hurry up!

391
00:26:38,519 --> 00:26:40,000
Come on, a toast to Sister Tian.

392
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:40,680
What is it?

393
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:41,880
Come on, come on.

394
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:43,160
Thank you, everyone. Thank you.

395
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,400
To Sister Tian!

396
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:45,559
Bottoms up, bottoms up!

397
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:33,799
My bro's looking for you.

398
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:35,160
I've been waiting for your word.

399
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,200
What I asked you to find out...

400
00:27:36,319 --> 00:27:37,200
No news on that yet?

401
00:27:38,599 --> 00:27:39,319
What thing?

402
00:27:39,759 --> 00:27:40,559
About the meeting.

403
00:27:40,599 --> 00:27:41,200
What meeting?

404
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:42,359
Stop playing dumb.

405
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:44,759
I don't know anything.

406
00:27:45,200 --> 00:27:45,960
You don't know?

407
00:27:46,480 --> 00:27:47,759
You're with your master every day.

408
00:27:47,759 --> 00:27:48,279
And you don't know?

409
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:49,720
Your master schedules all the meetings.

410
00:27:49,759 --> 00:27:50,640
You think I'm stupid?

411
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:51,960
Spit it out.

412
00:27:52,839 --> 00:27:53,519
Bro, I...

413
00:27:54,039 --> 00:27:55,000
I really don't know.

414
00:27:55,079 --> 00:27:56,400
Nice bike you've got here.

415
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:58,200
Get off and think carefully.

416
00:27:58,279 --> 00:27:58,799
Off you go.

417
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:00,400
Let me take it for a spin.

418
00:28:00,519 --> 00:28:01,440
All right, bro.

419
00:28:03,559 --> 00:28:04,319
Think long and hard.

420
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:08,079
I really don't know.

421
00:28:08,720 --> 00:28:09,000
Fine. Fine.

422
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:09,680
Tell me right now, then.

423
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:11,200
When's the next meeting?

424
00:28:11,519 --> 00:28:12,319
Where is it being held?

425
00:28:13,079 --> 00:28:14,359
Who's attending?

426
00:28:14,599 --> 00:28:15,079
Speak up!

427
00:28:15,079 --> 00:28:15,960
The questions I just asked you...

428
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:16,960
Answer me!

429
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:20,240
Bro, I really don't know what to say!

430
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:21,960
Are you pushing your luck?

431
00:28:22,359 --> 00:28:23,680
Are you pushing your luck?

432
00:28:23,759 --> 00:28:24,839
How could you not know?

433
00:28:26,119 --> 00:28:26,960
Why aren't you talking?

434
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:28,039
What are you doing?

435
00:28:28,720 --> 00:28:29,400
Bullying him?

436
00:28:32,079 --> 00:28:33,559
The Factory Belle is here.

437
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:35,759
What are you yelling for?

438
00:28:35,759 --> 00:28:36,519
Just asking a few questions.

439
00:28:38,079 --> 00:28:39,079
All of you together...

440
00:28:39,079 --> 00:28:40,240
...ganging up on him?

441
00:28:40,599 --> 00:28:41,519
Aren't you ashamed of yourselves?

442
00:28:41,720 --> 00:28:42,839
Sis, don't bother with them.

443
00:28:43,279 --> 00:28:44,519
Get out of the way!

444
00:28:44,599 --> 00:28:45,519
Let him go!

445
00:28:45,519 --> 00:28:46,480
Sis, don't worry about me.

446
00:28:46,559 --> 00:28:47,279
Just go!

447
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:48,599
Shut up!

448
00:28:49,160 --> 00:28:50,559
Wait, aren't you two in different workshops?

449
00:28:50,880 --> 00:28:51,759
What's the deal between you two?

450
00:28:51,759 --> 00:28:52,519
Let him go!

451
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:53,960
Is there no law anymore?

452
00:28:54,319 --> 00:28:54,960
The law?

453
00:28:55,079 --> 00:28:55,839
What the hell is the law?

454
00:28:56,039 --> 00:28:56,960
Sis, stay out of this.

455
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:57,319
Shut up!

456
00:28:57,319 --> 00:28:58,079
Just leave, sis.

457
00:28:58,559 --> 00:28:59,160
Get out of here, quick!

458
00:29:00,039 --> 00:29:01,480
Can one of you explain this?

459
00:29:01,519 --> 00:29:02,759
What's really going on with you two?

460
00:29:03,039 --> 00:29:04,119
If you want something, come at me!

461
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:06,160
You actually bagged the Factory Belle?

462
00:29:07,079 --> 00:29:08,160
Care to explain that?

463
00:29:08,480 --> 00:29:09,759
You nailed the Factory Belle?

464
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:11,039
You nailed the Factory Belle?

465
00:29:11,119 --> 00:29:11,759
You nailed the Factory...

466
00:29:11,759 --> 00:29:12,240
Sis, go!

467
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:12,880
You nailed the Factory...

468
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:13,680
Go, sis!

469
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:14,480
I'm talking to you!

470
00:29:17,240 --> 00:29:17,759
Still want a piece of me?

471
00:29:18,039 --> 00:29:19,039
You nailed the Factory Belle?

472
00:29:19,039 --> 00:29:20,039
You nailed the Factory Belle?

473
00:29:21,119 --> 00:29:21,839
Get lost!

474
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:28,039
Out of the way! Move!

475
00:29:28,079 --> 00:29:29,839
Hitting people, huh?! Take that!

476
00:29:29,839 --> 00:29:31,000
That's for picking on people!

477
00:29:31,039 --> 00:29:32,200
Move! Get out of the way!

478
00:29:32,240 --> 00:29:32,759
Move!

479
00:29:32,799 --> 00:29:33,960
I told you to back off!

480
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:35,039
Picking on people!

481
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:36,000
Move!

482
00:29:36,519 --> 00:29:37,519
That'll teach you to bully people!

483
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:39,680
Picking on an honest man, are you?!

484
00:29:40,279 --> 00:29:40,960
Stop!

485
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:42,200
Stop, stop, stop!

486
00:29:42,759 --> 00:29:43,839
Listen to me!

487
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:45,759
The folks at the plant haven't clocked out yet!

488
00:29:46,039 --> 00:29:47,000
I'm calling for help!

489
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,839
Think you can push honest folks around?!

490
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:49,480
Back off!

491
00:29:49,480 --> 00:29:49,960
Don't move!

492
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:50,680
Out of the way!

493
00:29:50,799 --> 00:29:51,680
Help!

494
00:29:52,079 --> 00:29:53,039
Somebody help!

495
00:29:53,119 --> 00:29:54,359
Try bullying him again!

496
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:55,160
Help!

497
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:56,039
What's your problem?! Get lost!

498
00:29:58,599 --> 00:29:59,160
What's going on?

499
00:30:00,160 --> 00:30:00,559
You...

500
00:30:00,839 --> 00:30:01,240
What do you want?

501
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:02,119
Get the hell out of here!

502
00:30:02,119 --> 00:30:02,960
Just you wait!

503
00:30:03,960 --> 00:30:04,720
Don't run!

504
00:30:06,039 --> 00:30:06,799
Let's go!

505
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:11,880
Sis, are you okay?

506
00:30:13,240 --> 00:30:14,000
I'm fine.

507
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:15,400
How about you?

508
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:16,720
I'm okay, Sis.

509
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:19,640
Sis is here.

510
00:30:20,079 --> 00:30:20,720
Don't be scared.

511
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:46,000
I hate bullies who pick on the weak.

512
00:30:52,480 --> 00:30:53,279
Sis, just you wait.

513
00:30:54,839 --> 00:30:55,720
One of these days,

514
00:30:56,119 --> 00:30:57,799
I'll show everyone who messes with us...

515
00:30:57,799 --> 00:30:58,880
...what I'm really made of.

516
00:31:02,359 --> 00:31:04,039
Why didn't you tell your master?

517
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:05,799
I'm a grown man.

518
00:31:07,119 --> 00:31:08,960
Telling him would be embarrassing.

519
00:31:10,359 --> 00:31:12,240
If I hadn't run into you today,

520
00:31:12,559 --> 00:31:13,480
what would you have done alone?

521
00:31:13,640 --> 00:31:14,519
There were so many of them.

522
00:31:20,720 --> 00:31:21,519
So what?

523
00:31:23,640 --> 00:31:25,279
Even if they beat me to death, I'd never talk.

524
00:31:29,039 --> 00:31:30,200
What a stubborn fool.

525
00:31:32,240 --> 00:31:34,240
Does it still hurt? Are you injured anywhere?

526
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:35,880
A bunch of bastards. I'm fine.

527
00:31:36,039 --> 00:31:37,160
They really beat you up bad.

528
00:31:41,279 --> 00:31:42,240
What are you laughing at?

529
00:31:46,519 --> 00:31:47,599
You're still laughing?

530
00:31:48,640 --> 00:31:49,720
Did they knock you silly?

531
00:31:50,240 --> 00:31:50,839
No, Sis.

532
00:31:51,440 --> 00:31:52,119
I was just thinking...

533
00:31:52,839 --> 00:31:53,519
Well...

534
00:31:54,119 --> 00:31:54,880
Usually,

535
00:31:55,319 --> 00:31:57,400
you seem so delicate and frail.

536
00:31:58,440 --> 00:32:00,960
That heavy vintage bicycle weighs a ton.

537
00:32:01,519 --> 00:32:02,079
Yet you, Sis...

538
00:32:02,079 --> 00:32:03,599
...swung it around just like that!

539
00:32:03,880 --> 00:32:05,680
You should've seen how terrified Brother Lei was.

540
00:32:05,960 --> 00:32:07,200
He stumbled backward in panic!

541
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:09,160
I wasn't thinking at all back then.

542
00:32:09,880 --> 00:32:10,400
I don't even know...

543
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:11,799
...where I got all that strength.

544
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:40,880
All right.

545
00:32:41,160 --> 00:32:42,119
Head on back now.

546
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:43,960
I live right around here.

547
00:32:44,039 --> 00:32:45,079
I'll just walk back in a bit.

548
00:32:49,799 --> 00:32:50,240
Sis...

549
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:51,519
How about... How about I walk you up?

550
00:32:51,880 --> 00:32:52,400
No need.

551
00:32:52,599 --> 00:32:53,519
I'll make a phone call.

552
00:32:57,559 --> 00:32:57,960
Look,

553
00:32:58,680 --> 00:32:59,359
it's so late.

554
00:32:59,359 --> 00:33:00,200
Who could you call

555
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:00,960
that'd even pick up?

556
00:33:02,119 --> 00:33:03,279
Stay out of it, kid.

557
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:04,400
Head on home.

558
00:33:05,319 --> 00:33:05,880
Go on, hurry up.

559
00:33:12,480 --> 00:33:13,440
Take it easy on your bike.

560
00:33:14,079 --> 00:33:14,680
Be careful.

561
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:22,400
Sis, get home soon, all right?

562
00:33:37,559 --> 00:33:38,039
Tieping,

563
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:39,119
don't be scared.

564
00:33:39,440 --> 00:33:40,160
Whatever they ask you,

565
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:41,519
just say you don't know, and that's it.

566
00:33:43,960 --> 00:33:44,559
Director,

567
00:33:44,680 --> 00:33:46,799
you should find our Tieping a girlfriend.

568
00:33:47,240 --> 00:33:47,519
Yeah.

569
00:33:47,519 --> 00:33:48,440
That's not my job.

570
00:33:49,319 --> 00:33:50,279
If he's got what it takes,

571
00:33:50,480 --> 00:33:51,200
he can find one himself.

572
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:52,880
He's not getting any younger.

573
00:33:52,880 --> 00:33:53,720
What, can't you pull a girl?

574
00:33:54,079 --> 00:33:54,680
Get outta here, honestly...

575
00:33:54,960 --> 00:33:56,200
I'm still a bachelor myself.

576
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:57,359
How could I look after him?

577
00:33:58,640 --> 00:33:59,640
Tieping, look who's here!

578
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:00,839
Are you sneaking around behind Master's back

579
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:02,200
dating someone from the workshop?

580
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:03,559
No.

581
00:34:03,559 --> 00:34:04,200
The Factory Belle is here!

582
00:34:06,039 --> 00:34:06,839
Director! Director!

583
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,679
Liu Xuemei is a fine woman.

584
00:34:08,800 --> 00:34:09,760
She's raising a kid on her own,

585
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:11,920
and your wife took off with your daughter.

586
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:12,639
Why don't—

587
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:13,880
Why don't you two just get together?

588
00:34:14,039 --> 00:34:14,719
Stop talking nonsense!

589
00:34:15,159 --> 00:34:15,920
She doesn't feel that way.

590
00:34:16,440 --> 00:34:17,559
Right, don't talk rubbish.

591
00:34:17,719 --> 00:34:18,800
My master didn't mean that.

592
00:34:18,840 --> 00:34:19,800
Xuemei... You punk!

593
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:22,159
It's pretty late.

594
00:34:22,320 --> 00:34:23,679
Let Tieping walk you back.

595
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:24,440
No need.

596
00:34:26,840 --> 00:34:27,960
Chop-chop, hurry up!

597
00:34:30,079 --> 00:34:31,320
Director, you're such a wimp.

598
00:34:31,320 --> 00:34:32,079
Go after her!

599
00:34:32,360 --> 00:34:33,440
What are you babbling about?

600
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:34,360
Go after her!

601
00:34:34,599 --> 00:34:35,039
Tieping,

602
00:34:35,039 --> 00:34:36,079
make sure she gets all the way home!

603
00:35:27,519 --> 00:35:28,239
Are you okay, Sis?

604
00:35:29,639 --> 00:35:30,199
I'm fine.

605
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,000
Sis, we have to wait a bit for the train.

606
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:36,119
Does your head wound still hurt?

607
00:35:37,440 --> 00:35:38,119
Not anymore.

608
00:35:38,760 --> 00:35:39,519
Um...

609
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:40,480
The doctor said...

610
00:35:40,519 --> 00:35:41,440
...it might...

611
00:35:41,519 --> 00:35:42,159
...leave a scar.

612
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:43,960
A scar doesn't matter.

613
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:45,199
I look sharp anyway.

614
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:06,639
Sis, put it on.

615
00:36:07,280 --> 00:36:07,760
No need.

616
00:36:07,920 --> 00:36:08,559
I'm not cold.

617
00:36:08,760 --> 00:36:09,679
Just put it on.

618
00:36:09,840 --> 00:36:11,000
No, you keep it on.

619
00:36:11,920 --> 00:36:12,360
Come on, Sis.

620
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:13,239
Put it on.

621
00:36:13,639 --> 00:36:14,559
No need to be polite with me.

622
00:36:15,079 --> 00:36:15,639
Put it on.

623
00:36:19,199 --> 00:36:19,760
Thanks.

624
00:37:26,960 --> 00:37:27,880
She hates the cold.

625
00:37:29,320 --> 00:37:30,559
She must be so cold.

626
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:06,440
Any luck?

627
00:40:06,599 --> 00:40:07,079
Brother Chuang.

628
00:40:07,320 --> 00:40:08,760
We checked all the cameras by the intersection.

629
00:40:08,760 --> 00:40:09,199
Nothing.

630
00:40:11,199 --> 00:40:11,760
Brother Chuang.

631
00:40:12,039 --> 00:40:13,320
We searched the entire neighborhood.

632
00:40:13,559 --> 00:40:14,639
Checked the cameras around his place too.

633
00:40:14,760 --> 00:40:15,719
There's no sign of him at all.

634
00:40:16,559 --> 00:40:18,480
If he's out to avenge Liu Xuemei,

635
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:19,199
his next target...

636
00:40:19,199 --> 00:40:21,079
is bound to be someone tied to that old auction.

637
00:40:21,519 --> 00:40:22,440
The ones on that list.

638
00:40:24,280 --> 00:40:25,079
Right now,

639
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:26,960
contact everyone on the list.

640
00:40:27,039 --> 00:40:27,519
Split up.

641
00:40:28,360 --> 00:40:28,800
Got it, let's go.

642
00:40:31,679 --> 00:40:32,519
Is this Tu Chunyan?

643
00:40:33,159 --> 00:40:34,239
This is Gao Xuelin from Criminal Investigation.

644
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:35,119
Are you home?

645
00:40:35,960 --> 00:40:37,480
Good. Don't go anywhere today.

646
00:40:38,119 --> 00:40:38,760
No matter who comes knocking,

647
00:40:38,760 --> 00:40:39,480
don't open the door.

648
00:40:39,519 --> 00:40:40,719
Call me if anything happens.

649
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:42,440
All right.

650
00:40:42,639 --> 00:40:43,199
Talk soon.

651
00:40:46,840 --> 00:40:48,440
Have Liu Tieping and Cheng Youtian come by your place?

652
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:50,159
No, they haven't.

653
00:40:50,559 --> 00:40:50,840
Look,

654
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:52,480
the two of them never come here.

655
00:40:52,760 --> 00:40:53,760
There's a high chance you could be

656
00:40:53,760 --> 00:40:55,280
the killer's next target.

657
00:40:55,559 --> 00:40:56,000
Say what?

658
00:40:56,440 --> 00:40:57,519
I said there's a chance.

659
00:40:58,000 --> 00:40:59,159
We'll send someone to protect you.

660
00:41:00,119 --> 00:41:01,719
Be extra careful when you're out and about.

661
00:41:01,960 --> 00:41:03,000
Actually, it's best if you don't go out at all.

662
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:05,440
If you hear from them, let me know immediately.

663
00:41:05,559 --> 00:41:06,119
Got it?

664
00:41:07,039 --> 00:41:07,360
All right.

665
00:41:07,360 --> 00:41:07,840
Did you get through?

666
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:08,320
No.

667
00:41:09,639 --> 00:41:09,960
What...

668
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:11,199
What's going on here?

669
00:41:55,599 --> 00:41:56,239
Liu Xiaosheng.

670
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:02,079
I know

671
00:42:03,039 --> 00:42:04,599
the night your mother died,

672
00:42:04,960 --> 00:42:06,000
you were with her.

673
00:42:08,800 --> 00:42:09,519
How do you know?

674
00:42:10,239 --> 00:42:11,239
You weren't even there.

675
00:42:18,599 --> 00:42:19,639
The next morning,

676
00:42:20,079 --> 00:42:21,039
I went to the scene

677
00:42:22,280 --> 00:42:23,760
and photographed this under a bench.

678
00:42:25,199 --> 00:42:26,840
This glove has "Sheng" stitched on it.

679
00:42:27,960 --> 00:42:29,480
Your mother knitted it for you, didn't she?

680
00:42:33,119 --> 00:42:34,079
Ten thousand to touch.

681
00:42:35,199 --> 00:42:36,440
What... What about a kiss?

682
00:42:36,440 --> 00:42:37,079
Twenty thousand.

683
00:42:37,320 --> 00:42:37,880
Let me have a kiss.

684
00:42:37,880 --> 00:42:38,280
Come here.

685
00:42:41,039 --> 00:42:41,760
I really want to

686
00:42:42,440 --> 00:42:43,199
smack you to death.

687
00:42:44,440 --> 00:42:46,119
I never thought you'd be the one who stole the money.

688
00:42:46,519 --> 00:42:48,360
You're cut from the same cloth as Ma Guowen.

689
00:42:48,360 --> 00:42:49,440
I swear I didn't take that money.

690
00:42:50,000 --> 00:42:50,559
Damn it.
